  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Smelter.png|200px|left|Smelter]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Production Buildings|Machine]]\n |level = 24\n |price = 12,500 to 50,500\n |time = 18 h\n |slots = 1\n |dia = 42\n |size = 2×2\n}}\nThe '''Smelter''' is a [[Production Buildings|production building]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 24. Players can have up to five smelters.\n\nIt is used to make [[Silver Bar|silver bars]], [[Gold Bar|gold bars]], [[Platinum Bar|platinum bars]], [[Iron Bar|iron bars]], and [[Refined Coal|refined coal]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Appearance'''===\nThe Smelter is a brick furnace, with a chimney, an oven and a mold to pour molten metal or coal into. A casket of ore sits next to it.\n\nThe mastered version has a golden star on its basket, as well as copper bricks.\n----\n=== '''Building''' ===\nIt takes 18 hours or 42 {{Infoicon|dia}} to build each smelter and gives players 21 {{Infoicon|xp}} when completed. It costs more and more coins to build them:\n* 12,500 {{Infoicon|coin}} for the 1st one\n* 22,000 {{Infoicon|coin}} for the 2nd one\n* 31,500 {{Infoicon|coin}} for the 3rd one\n* 41,000 {{Infoicon|coin}} for the 4th one\n* 50,500 {{Infoicon|coin}} for the 5th one\n*Each smelter costs 9,500 coins more than the previous one\n\n----\n=== '''Products''' ===\n{{Building Products\n|Silver Bar|24|8h|147\n|Gold Bar|25|12h|180\n|Platinum Bar|25|16h|205\n|Refined Coal|33|6h|108\n|Iron Bar|34|7h|129\n}}\n----\n=== '''Upgrading''' ===\n{{Main|Production Buildings}}\nThe Smelter originally has one slot available. Unlocking the second slot costs 6 [[diamond]]s. Players can unlock 8 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more {{Infoicon|dia}} than the previous one. Alternatively, they can spend a total of 132 {{Infoicon|dia}} to completely upgrade their machine.\n----\n=== '''Mastering''' ===\nA total of 8,110 hours of production is required to [[Masteries|master]] the Smelter:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 1em 0; border-collapse: collapse;\"\n|-\n|rowspan=\"3\"|[[File:Smelter Mastered.png|150px|Mastered Smelter]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★<br />390 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★<br />1,540 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★★<br />6,180 hrs'''\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM10Coins.png|100px]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM10XP.png|100px|]]\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Smelter Mastery.png|100px]]\n|-\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''<span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% {{Infoicon|coin}}</span>'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''<span title=\"10% more experience points for truck orders\">+10% {{Infoicon|xp}}</span>'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''15% faster'''\n|}\n----\n=== '''Strategy tips''' ===\n*Each bar requires 3 units of ore.\n*Producing bars is tied to the Helter Smelter [[Achievements|achievement]].\n*The Smelter is very hard to master if you do not have five of them.\n*Selling bars is not profitable at all considering the time it takes to make them.\n----\n[[ru:Плавильня]]\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Schmelzofen\n|es = Fundición\n|fr = Fonderie\n|it = Fonderia\n|no = Smelteovn\n|vi = Lò luyện kim\n|zh = Smelter\n}}\n[[pt-br:Fundidor]]\n[[ru:Плавильня]]\n[[Category:Production Buildings]]",
  "wikitextHash": "ac670ef4deeef2d243de4d0ff254a9bd7bd90fcfd0279baa3ad87408cbe272fe"
